@	
s	list	List all the supported mackup applications
s	backup	Sync your conf files to your synced storage
s	restore	Link the conf files already in your synced storage on your system
s	show	Show the current configuration
s	uninstall	Reset everything as it was before using Mackup
o	--help|-h	Show help	
o	--force|-f	Force every question asked to be answered with 'Yes'	
o	--root|-r	Allow mackup to be run as superuser	
o	--dry-run|-n	Show steps without executing	
o	--version	Show version	
@	list
@	backup
@	restore
@	show
a	1	0
#	show	1
d
@	uninstall
